{"articleNo":"330161","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=330161&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] 삼성전자 협력회사채용박람회 개최 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2021.10.20","hit":"24358","attachments":[{"name":"2021 삼성전자 협력회사 온라인 채용박람회 참가기업_211001.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=330161&attachNo=105459"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: Nanum Gothic, NanumGothic, 나눔고딕, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(207, 226, 243);\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>[행사개요]</strong></span></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">   </span></p><div style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Nanum Gothic,NanumGothic,나눔고딕,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>행 &nbsp;사 &nbsp;명</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> : 2021 삼성전자 협력회사 온라인 채용박람회</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">   </span></div><div style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Nanum Gothic,NanumGothic,나눔고딕,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>기 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 간</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> : 2021. 10. 13(수) - 26(화)&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; </span></div><div style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Nanum Gothic,NanumGothic,나눔고딕,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>웹페이지&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">: 삼성전자 협력회사 채용관 內(취업포털사이트 '사람인' 內)</span></span></div><div style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Nanum Gothic,NanumGothic,나눔고딕,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">☞</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕;\"><strong><a href=\"http://www.samsung-myjob.com/fair\" target=\"_blank\" data-cke-saved-href=\"http://www.samsung-myjob.com/fair\"><strong><u><font color=\"#0066cc\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">http://www.samsung-myjob.com/fair</span></font></u></strong></a></strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> </span></span></div><div style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Nanum Gothic,NanumGothic,나눔고딕,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ☞&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕;\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.saramin.co.kr/zf_user/jobs/theme/samsung-jobfair\" target=\"_blank\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.saramin.co.kr/zf_user/jobs/theme/samsung-jobfair\"><strong><u><font color=\"#0066cc\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">https://www.saramin.co.kr/zf_user/jobs/theme/samsung-jobfair</span></font></u></strong></a></strong></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Nanum Gothic,NanumGothic,나눔고딕,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>규 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 모</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> : 우수 협력회사 53개사 참가</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">   </span></div><div style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Nanum Gothic,NanumGothic,나눔고딕,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>행사구성</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> : 채용관(기업채용정보 확인 및 이력서 지원), 온라인설명회, 이벤트</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">   </span></div><div style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Nanum Gothic,NanumGothic,나눔고딕,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>참가방법</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; 1) 취업포털 및 취업커뮤니티 등에 게시된 온라인 배너 클릭하여 박람회 페이지 입장</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">   </span></div><div style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Nanum Gothic,NanumGothic,나눔고딕,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 2) 취업포털 사람인 접속 → 삼성전자 협력회사 전용관 접속 → 온라인 박람회 배너 클릭하여 입장</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">   </span></div><div style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Nanum Gothic,NanumGothic,나눔고딕,sans-serif;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">   </span></div><div style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Nanum Gothic,NanumGothic,나눔고딕,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(207, 226, 243);\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>※ 비대면 온라인 채용설명회 실시 (10.20~21)</strong></span></strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">   </span></div><div style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Nanum Gothic,NanumGothic,나눔고딕,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>- 설명회 기업</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> : [10.20 (수)] </span><span style=\"color: windowtext; font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">케이케이테크㈜, </span><span style=\"color: windowtext; font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">어보브반도체㈜, </span><span style=\"color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt;\">㈜와이솔</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">   </span></div><div style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Nanum Gothic,NanumGothic,나눔고딕,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: windowtext; font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"color: windowtext; font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"color: windowtext; font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"color: windowtext; font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;[10.21 (목)] ㈜위드텍, </span><span style=\"color: windowtext; font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">㈜동진쎄미켐, </span><span style=\"color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt;\">삼영순화㈜</span></span></span><br></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">   </span></div><div style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Nanum Gothic,NanumGothic,나눔고딕,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>- 신청기간</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> : 2021. 10. 13(수) - 15(금)</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">   </span></div><div style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Nanum Gothic,NanumGothic,나눔고딕,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>- 신청방법</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> : 박람회 페이지 &gt; 공지사항 內 이벤트 게시글에서 신청(네이버폼)</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">   </span></div><div style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Nanum Gothic,NanumGothic,나눔고딕,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; * 선착순 100명, 조기마감</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> </span></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"></span><img class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" alt=\"[교외행사]\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t삼성전자 협력회사채용박람회 개최 안내\" src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmEYHpxSHcCKBBAIgBwMIC8CeB1AcQA0B5ATQGsAVAGSRoFEBDAOgCs0BzIA%20\"></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
